title: Notify --list-targets should use local DB instead of API for known conversations
updated_at: "2026-08-02T03:30:50Z"
---
Currently --list-targets for Teams calls the Bot Framework GET /v3/conversations endpoint, which returns HTTP 405. We already have known conversation IDs in the session_state table (SQLite). The --list-targets flag should query the local DB for known conversation/chat IDs rather than making a network call. For Telegram, same approach: query known chat IDs from the DB. The API call can be a fallback or secondary mode if needed, but the primary source should be local.